extends RefCounted
class_name Deck
## The deck of choice cards. Pure data — logic lives in cards.gd.
##
## Card fields:
##   id, title, art (Art sprite key), text (flavour, ~120 chars max)
##   rarity  1 common · 2 uncommon · 3 rare · 4 legendary · 0 = never drawn (follow-up only)
##   level   min farm level to be drawn        weird  min weirdness to be drawn
##   needs   [requirements] that must hold for the card to be drawn at all
##   visitor true = the art walks onto the farm as a visitor when you choose
##   a / b   choices: {label (<=20 chars), desc (<=80 chars), req: [...], fx: [...], reply: "visitor line"}
##
## Requirements (all must hold; costs in fx are auto-added as requirements):
##   ["crop", type, n] n growing (alive, any stage; type "" = any)   ["ripe", type, n]
##   ["obj", type, n] objects/structures on the farm   ["relic", id]   ["no_relic", id]
##   ["weather", w]   ["night"]   ["day"]   ["level", n]   ["weird", n]   ["mood", n]
##   ["health", n]   ["chickens", n]   ["tilled", n]   ["charms", n]   ["stat", name, n]
##   ["inventory", n] (any items)   ["coins", n]   ["item", id, n]
##
## Effects:
##   ["coins", n] (+ scales with level, - is a cost)   ["coins_pct", pct]   ["item", id, n]
##   ["heal", n] (- hurts, Lucky Charms block)   ["energy", n]   ["mood", n]   ["weird", n]
##   ["poison", secs]   ["cure"]   ["charm", n]   ["buff", name, secs]   ["weather", w, secs]
##   ["action", id] (rain shoo dog bloom bees meteor quake tree merchant critters storm clear fert)
##   ["event", id] (crows rabbits fox boar snake wasps weeds butterflies lucky)
##   ["spawn", kind, n]   ["grow", amount]   ["ripen", n|-1]   ["wither", n|-1]   ["mutate", n]
##   ["plant", crop, n]   ["unlock", crop]   ["favor", crop, secs]   ["relic", id]   ["lose_relic", id]
##   ["draw", n]   ["chicken", n]   ["sell", mult]   ["take_ripe", crop, n]   ["take_crop", crop, n]
##   ["water_all"]   ["clear_weeds"]   ["burn", obj_type]   ["add_card", id]   ["say", text]   ["log", text]
##   ["gamble", chance, [fx if lucky], [fx if not]]   ["delay", secs, [fx], "log note"]
## Buff names: sun (2x growth), growth (1.5x), dog, bounty, crow_truce, boar_guard, favor

